	(text "Derived from \"Four Motor Control Board M5\" - that board ships as a PCB with no schematic, so this sheet is reconstructed from its netlist.  H1 (2x5 board-to-board header) removed; BoardCom is now the hierarchical link to the driver section.  VCC renamed VIN and 3V3 renamed +3V3_MC.  Reference designators are the originals + 100."
